WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.010
- So, I'm gonna start with this

00:00:02.010 --> 00:00:03.570
'cause it seems like a crazy number.

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:05.160
25 million Instagram followers.

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:06.360
Is there pressure in that?

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:08.370
Do you feel like you have
to post at that point?

00:00:08.370 --> 00:00:10.770
- Yeah, I definitely do feel that,

00:00:10.770 --> 00:00:13.320
but I also give myself
the liberty to just like,

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:14.572
not care that much.

00:00:14.572 --> 00:00:15.405
- Good.

00:00:15.405 --> 00:00:17.388
- I feel like I'm constantly like,

00:00:17.388 --> 00:00:18.690
I probably shouldn't say this.

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:19.650
- It's like a whole separate job.

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:21.930
- I'm like, I like
continuously lose followers

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:23.580
every time I post.

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:25.883
So I feel like I'm like,
"All right, bye, I guess."

00:00:25.883 --> 00:00:28.800
So, I'm like, maybe it's better
if I just don't remind them

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:30.990
that they're following me, and then.

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:32.125
- Just under the radar.

00:00:32.125 --> 00:00:32.970
- Yeah.

00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:34.410
- You're turning 30 soon.

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:35.670
Are you excited about this?

00:00:35.670 --> 00:00:37.470
- I'm really excited to turn 30.

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:38.303
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:38.303 --> 00:00:39.247
- I'm like...

00:00:39.247 --> 00:00:40.080
- [Kelly] Thirties are fun.

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:40.913
- That's what I hear.
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:40.913 --> 00:00:42.240
- I just feel like your
thirties, especially as a woman,

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:43.920
it's really when you come into yourself

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:46.020
and you stop caring about
what other people think.

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:46.853
- Yeah.

00:00:46.853 --> 00:00:48.630
- I feel like that's
already coming for me.

00:00:48.630 --> 00:00:51.840
And you know, with "Riverdale"
ending after seven years,

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:54.420
I'm like, this feels
like a really great time

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:55.290
to be turning 30.

00:00:55.290 --> 00:00:56.589
- [Kelly] Yeah.
- It's like a new chapter.

00:00:56.589 --> 00:00:58.590
- I'm excited for you, I
love my thirties, that's fun.

00:00:58.590 --> 00:00:59.423
How do you celebrate?

00:00:59.423 --> 00:01:00.637
You go big or do you chill?

00:01:00.637 --> 00:01:03.660
- I like to have, I'm very social.

00:01:03.660 --> 00:01:07.383
I like to have everyone
gather for my birthday.

00:01:08.370 --> 00:01:11.665
I really wanna have a bounce
house birthday for my thirties.

00:01:11.665 --> 00:01:13.223
(audience cheering)
- I love you.

00:01:14.248 --> 00:01:15.081
I love that.

00:01:15.081 --> 00:01:18.870
- I wanna just get a big bounce
house and invite everyone

00:01:18.870 --> 00:01:20.790
and have a themed,

00:01:20.790 --> 00:01:23.400
like a kid's themed birthday,
maybe like, you know.

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:24.233
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:24.233 --> 00:01:27.060
- Some Disney character
as my cake or something.

00:01:27.060 --> 00:01:29.520
- Have a petting zoo.
- [Camila] Yeah, exactly.

00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:32.340
- I will tell you, during
COVID, it saved us.

00:01:32.340 --> 00:01:34.320
I ordered on, thank you, Amazon.

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:37.740
I ordered a bounce house
'cause my kids were going nuts

00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:39.270
