00:01:39.270 --> 00:01:40.413
and all that stuff with COVID.

00:01:40.413 --> 00:01:41.340
- [Camila] So, you're like
get these guys a bounce house.

00:01:41.340 --> 00:01:43.020
- The bounce house saved us.

00:01:43.020 --> 00:01:44.790
So I applaud a bounce house move

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:46.410
- You were just on the
bounce house every day.

00:01:46.410 --> 00:01:48.390
- Yeah, go get that energy out.

00:01:48.390 --> 00:01:49.331
- It was for you, Kelly,

00:01:49.331 --> 00:01:51.263
admit it.
- Get out of the house, yeah.

